<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $193 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $193 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Thursday it placed $193 million in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money fell to 5.48 percent from 5.63 percent at the close Wednesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar was flat at 0.99985 pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0657))</p>
</text>
